<title>USA: PHLX to list Pacific Sunwear options.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list Pacific Sunwear options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said it would list options on Pacific Sunwear of California Inc shares on February 12.</p>
<p>The options will have initial strike prices of 22-1/2, 25 and 30, with expirations in March, April, June and September, the exchange said. Position limit is 7,500 contracts.</p>
<p>TFM Investment Group will be the specialist on the PHLX floor.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
